{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は朝からある雑誌の撮影をしてきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幼少期の話しや\n学生の頃の話しをしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういう機会がないと思い出すこともないから、今日はよかったです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい頃からいまの乃木坂までの\n話をしていて思ったのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の家族はいつでもどんな時でも\n私の1番の味方ということです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にだいすきな家族！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも本当にありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/18/4609230/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/18/4609230/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/18/4609230/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何でも器用にこなせるようになりたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心の中や頭の中で\nいろいろなことを考えたり思ったりは\nできるけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それを上手に使いこなせない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんていうんだろう。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑ったり騒いだりするけど\n1つの感情が重くなって心にできると\nそれから離れるのに時間がかかっちゃう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"考えすぎだし\nネガティヴすぎるせいもあるんだけど。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"世の中は儚いもので溢れてる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"儚すぎて一瞬で\nそれが素敵で素晴らしくて\nそれが切なくて悲しくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は何でもネガティヴに捉えちゃうから\nもったいないことをしてると思います"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっとポジティブに考えたら\nもっと明るくなれるし楽しく過ごせる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の周りには私をポジティブにしてくれる方が\nたくさんいますっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日のライブもがんばるぞ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/18/4609230/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/18/4609230/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"侍メンバー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マドンナジャパンさんが\n5連覇できるように\n毎日お祈りしてます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんも一緒に応援してください♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/18/4609230/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、従兄弟のお家から素敵なものか\n届きました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またかくねっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それではきょうはこのへんで